WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.333
While journeying to the Coumarine City Gym

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.966
and Ash's fourth Gym Battle challenge,

3
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:10.966
our heroes have stopped for a little lunch.

4
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.666
Mm. I'm full.

5
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.166
How about a nice Poké Puff for dessert?

6
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:20.433
I made plenty for everyone!

7
00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:24.066
-There's nothing left.

8
00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.366
Hey, could it be...

9
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.933
Hm?

10
00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:35.100
- Oh no. Not again...
- Che!

11
00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:38.333
- Pancham.
- No, Pancham, it's OK.

12
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.433
Chespin!

13
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.433
Che! Che!

14
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.833
Chespin, Chespin!

15
00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:44.500
Hey, stop fighting!

16
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:46.466
Stop, Chespin. What are you doing?

17
00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:49.766
Pancham, Pancham! Cham, Pancham! Pancham!

18
00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:55.333
Listen, both of you!

19
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.333
Don't you remember you're supposed to be friends? Now make up!

20
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.400
- Cham!
- Pin!

21
00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:04.666
Hey. All you're doing is just being plain mean to each other. Come on.

22
00:01:04.733 --> 00:01:06.233
- Pin!
- Cham!

23
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.166
- Stop!
- Pin!

24
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.166
Che! Pin, pin!

25
00:01:11.233 --> 00:01:13.066
- Chespin! Huh?
- Che, che, che!

26
00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:16.066
- Che, che, che!
- Pancham, what are you doing?

27
00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:18.500
- Man, what are you gonna do?
- Pika!

28
00:01:18.566 --> 00:01:21.133
Chespin, Chespin. Chespin!

29
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.733
Chespin! Che! Che! Chespin.

30
00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.400
- Aah!
- Che!

31
00:01:26.466 --> 00:01:28.766
- Chespin!
- Yaah!

32
00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:34.100
- Smoochum.
- Farfetch'd.

33
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:36.766
What do you think you're doing to my Pokémon, huh?

34
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:38.600
- Che!
- There you are.

35
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:40.766
- What's going on?
- Hey, you!

36
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.700
Are these two ill-mannered brats your Pokémon?

37
00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:47.266
They used Tackle on my Pokémon for no reason.

38
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:49.366
- Forgive me, please?
- Sorry!

39
00:01:49.433 --> 00:01:52.766
- Pancham, apologise right now.
- Chespin, you too.

40
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:53.833
- Chespin.
- Pancham.

41
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:56.333
What's going on?

42
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.933
Looks like these two got into more trouble.

43
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.500
Huh? Sorry.

44
00:02:00.566 --> 00:02:02.500
Whatever, it's fine.

45
00:02:02.566 --> 00:02:05.400
Now, let's keep training for the Pokémon Showcase.

46
00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:07.233
-Pokémon Showcase?

47
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.733
I was thinking about entering as well!

48
00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:11.366
Oh, really?

49
00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:12.933
Aah!

50
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.433
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

51
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.933
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

52
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.566
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

53
00:02:20.633 --> 00:02:22.333
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

54
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.400
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

55
00:02:25.466 --> 00:02:29.033
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

56
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:32.333
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

57
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.666
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

58
00:02:36.733 --> 00:02:40.766
♪ The future of the world is in your hand ♪

59
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:41.966
♪ Pokémon! ♪

60
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.933
Pathways to Performance Partnering!

61
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.933
- See, this will be my very first time.
- Me, too!

62
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.533
But I get no feedback, practising all by myself.

63
00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.233
Hey, would you please watch my performance and tell me what you think?

64
00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.833
But I don't really know enough to judge someone else's performance.

65
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.633
- Don't worry about it.
- Well, in that case...

66
00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.200
- I'd like to hear what you think, too.
- Sure.

67
00:03:12.266 --> 00:03:13.733
- OK.
- All right.

68
00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.533
So, these two are your partners?

69
00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:19.166
Smoochum. The Kiss Pokémon.

70
00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:21.100
Smoochum's lips are quite sensitive,

71
00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:23.866
so it uses them first to investigate objects.

72
00:03:23.933 --> 00:03:27.000
Farfetch'd. The Wild Duck Pokémon.

73
00:03:27.066 --> 00:03:29.400
Farfetch'd uses the stalk it holds as a weapon,

74
00:03:29.466 --> 00:03:32.300
wielding it like a sword to cut a variety of objects.

75
00:03:32.366 --> 00:03:36.166
I wonder what their performances will be like.

76
00:03:36.233 --> 00:03:37.800
Now, just watch.

77
00:03:37.866 --> 00:03:39.600
Smoochum, you first.

78
00:03:39.666 --> 00:03:42.000
Powder Snow!

79
00:03:47.366 --> 00:03:49.900
Smoo, smoo!

80
00:03:49.966 --> 00:03:52.133
Next, Farfetch'd!

81
00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.866
Far! Farfetch'd!

82
00:03:56.933 --> 00:03:59.600
Far, far, far! Far!

83
00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.366
- Ah!
- Farfetch'd! Farfetch'd!

84
00:04:08.166 --> 00:04:10.466
Aah! Smoochum! Heart Stamp!

85
00:04:10.533 --> 00:04:12.333
Smooch!

86
00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.833
Farfetch'd, Fury Cutter!

87
00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.666
Farfetch, fetch, fetch, fetch, fetch!

88
00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.833
- Fini.
- Fetch'd.

89
00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.400
-Awesome!

90
00:04:25.466 --> 00:04:28.400
Excellent. An incredible Pokémon performance.

91
00:04:28.466 --> 00:04:30.733
- Yeah. That was great.
- Pikachu!

92
00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.733
Oh! And my theme is heartbreak.

93
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.733
Huh.

94
00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.733
Now tell the truth. Is there something I should fix?

95
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.933
Well, I was thinking perhaps you could coordinate their dance

96
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.933
just a teeny tiny bit more.

97
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.166
More coordination on the dance, right.

98
00:04:46.233 --> 00:04:47.933
I was thinking it'd be really awesome

99
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.233
if you made that Heart Stamp a little flashier.

100
00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.600
Hm, the Heart Stamp a little flashier...

101
00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:55.166
Serena?

102
00:04:55.233 --> 00:04:58.466
It would be a big help if you could show me your performance.

103
00:04:58.533 --> 00:05:02.133
Well, honestly, I'm not really ready to show anyone just yet.

104
00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.233
- I wanna see it. Please?
- I'd like to see it, too.

105
00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:08.033
- Same for me.
- Pikachu!

106
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:12.033
- OK. Ready, Fennekin? Pancham?
- Hm!

107
00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.000
- Chespin! Che!
- Cham!

108
00:05:14.066 --> 00:05:16.000
Why's Chespin doing that?

109
00:05:16.066 --> 00:05:19.400
I guess it still must be trying to show Pancham up.

110
00:05:19.466 --> 00:05:21.433
- Pika.
- Pancham, cham!

111
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.900
Chespin, Chespin!

112
00:05:22.966 --> 00:05:26.166
- Come on! Break it up!
- Pika, pika!

113
00:05:26.233 --> 00:05:29.500
Chespin, would you like to be in the performance, too?

114
00:05:29.566 --> 00:05:31.100
- Pin.
- I've got it!

115
00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:32.166
Che!

116
00:05:32.233 --> 00:05:35.333
Now, if that's what you want, then leave everything to me.

117
00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:40.366
The future is now, thanks to science. Clemontic Gear, on!

118
00:05:40.433 --> 00:05:43.400
I've got the perfect machine for a situation like this.

119
00:05:43.466 --> 00:05:47.566
So, now, presenting my Only Lonely Dancing Robo-Partner!

120
00:05:47.633 --> 00:05:50.800
- What is it?
- My big brother's an inventor.

121
00:05:50.866 --> 00:05:53.166
- Hm.
- Power on!

122
00:05:53.233 --> 00:05:57.000
OK, Chespin, now you can dance to your little heart's content!

123
00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.533
Che...

124
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:04.000
Chespin! Chespin! Che!

125
00:06:04.066 --> 00:06:06.333
- Wow, science is so amazing.
- Che!

126
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.633
Clemont's invention is simply incredible!

127
00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:12.300
Che! Che-e-e-e-e-e!

128
00:06:15.233 --> 00:06:16.733
Che... uh...

129
00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.200
- Uh-oh.
- Something's gone wrong!

130
00:06:20.266 --> 00:06:23.533
Che-e-e-e-e-e-e!

131
00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:28.533
- Clemont! Turn it off!
- As soon as I can find the off button!

132
00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.100
Clemont, looks like it happened again.

133
00:06:34.166 --> 00:06:36.200
- I'm so sorry.
- Chespin.

134
00:06:39.233 --> 00:06:42.566
Chespin... Che!

135
00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.733
- Good luck, Serena!
- Pika, pika!

136
00:06:49.033 --> 00:06:50.233
Let's do this, you two!

137
00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.833
- Fennekin!
- Yah!

138
00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:57.033
- Go! Now, Fennekin, use Flamethrower!
- Fennekin!

139
00:06:58.366 --> 00:07:00.600
Cham, cham, cham, Pancham!

140
00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:02.100
Ooh!

141
00:07:02.166 --> 00:07:04.033
Ha-ha!

142
00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.233
- Pokémon Showcase practising?
- A waste of time.

143
00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.533
Without batting an eyelash,

144
00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:21.133
I will have earned the title of Kalos Queen with the greatest of ease.

145
00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:24.033
Now. Look! That's a Smoochum!

146
00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:28.533
Mm! Look at those lips. They're the cutest of cuteness.

147
00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.633
Eh... So, we'll catch Smoochum,

148
00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.400
and then we'll win the Pokémon Showcase together.

149
00:07:33.466 --> 00:07:37.300
- What happened to going after Pikachu?
- First things first!

150
00:07:37.366 --> 00:07:41.800
Catching Smoochum is tops on my to-do list, and then Pikachu will follow.

151
00:07:42.733 --> 00:07:45.233
One look at my lilting loveliness will prove

152
00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:50.000
that there's only one performer qualified to earn the hallowed title of Kalos Queen.

153
00:07:50.066 --> 00:07:51.733
It's meant to be.

154
00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:55.400
The sooner you accept that fact, the sooner the world will see.

155
00:07:55.466 --> 00:07:56.766
Whoopee.

156
00:07:56.833 --> 00:08:01.000
By snatching that Smoochum, I'll take my first royal step.

157
00:08:01.066 --> 00:08:02.566
Yeah, bet it's a doozy!

158
00:08:02.633 --> 00:08:04.533
Pancham!

159
00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.200
All right, Fennekin, use Flamethrower.

160
00:08:07.266 --> 00:08:10.366
Fennekin!

161
00:08:12.233 --> 00:08:14.233
Whoa!

162
00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.433
- And fini!
- Ah!

163
00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.000
- Yeah! Wow, Serena, that was awesome!
- Pika, pika!

164
00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:24.900
- I loved it!
- It was super good!

165
00:08:24.966 --> 00:08:27.066
But I kind of felt like Pancham's acrobatics

166
00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:29.433
didn't quite fit with the rest of the performance.

167
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.233
Really?

168
00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:35.200
Pancham's movements were swift and strong, but how do I say it?

169
00:08:35.266 --> 00:08:38.633
They don't seem to mesh with what you and Fennekin are doing.

170
00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.166
I'll have to think about that.

171
00:08:41.166 --> 00:08:44.933
- Mm! Smooch, Smooch, Smooch!
- Aah!

172
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.166
- Smooch!
- Argh!

173
00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.400
Smoochum, what's going on? Do you have a crush on Pancham?

174
00:08:49.466 --> 00:08:51.466
- Really? On Pancham?
- Che?

175
00:08:51.533 --> 00:08:54.000
I think they make a cute couple.

176
00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:56.533
The two of them are so sweet!

177
00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.266
- Couple?
- Mm-hm!

178
00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:00.666
Maybe the two of them should dance together.

179
00:09:00.733 --> 00:09:02.666
Uh, maybe...

180
00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.600
All right, let's go!

181
00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:09.533
- Cham, Pancham.
- Mm, mm.

182
00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:13.133
- Cham, Pancham.
- Mm, mm.

183
00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.100
- Pancham, cham.
- Mm!

184
00:09:15.166 --> 00:09:16.300
-Ha!

185
00:09:16.366 --> 00:09:18.100
- Pan!
- Smoochum!

186
00:09:18.166 --> 00:09:20.200
Pancham, Pancham! Pancham, Pancham, Pancham!

187
00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.233
- Smoochum!
- Pan, Pancham!

188
00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.300
- Cham!
- Smoochum!

189
00:09:24.433 --> 00:09:27.300
-That was pretty good!

190
00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:29.400
- Pancham, Pancham.
- You two were wonderful!

191
00:09:29.466 --> 00:09:32.100
- Just like I thought you'd be!
- Smoochum.

192
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:35.900
What do you think about trading your Pancham for one of my Pokémon?

193
00:09:35.966 --> 00:09:37.166
Did you say trade?

194
00:09:37.233 --> 00:09:38.700
- Che!
- Smooch!

195
00:09:38.766 --> 00:09:41.433
- Far!
- Well, how about it?

196
00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.466
Uh... But...

197
00:09:43.533 --> 00:09:46.733
- Pancham!
- Chespin! Che, che, che!

198
00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:51.466
- Hey! Chespin, will you cut it out?
- Che!

199
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.333
Sorry, Nini.

200
00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:58.133
You see, Pancham was the very first Pokémon I ever caught.

201
00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.400
And Pancham's gonna be my performance partner.

202
00:10:01.466 --> 00:10:03.833
Oh, well, too bad.

203
00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.400
- Cham.
- Che.

204
00:10:05.466 --> 00:10:06.766
Farfetch'd.

205
00:10:06.833 --> 00:10:09.033
But, watching the two of them perform,

206
00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.200
I understand how important dance choreography is.

207
00:10:12.266 --> 00:10:13.766
Yup, it's true.

208
00:10:17.033 --> 00:10:18.433
Huh?

209
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:22.600
- Well, not too bad, I guess!
- Mm-hm.

210
00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:28.600
So! You kids interested in Pokémon performance?

211
00:10:28.666 --> 00:10:30.133
- Huh?
- Yes, we are...

212
00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.633
Perfecto!

213
00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:36.133
Meet La Grande Dame Brûlée, cream of the choreographer crop!

214
00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.766
Choreographer crop?

215
00:10:37.833 --> 00:10:41.166
She's choreographed countless Pokémon performances.

216
00:10:41.233 --> 00:10:43.366
And created dozens of queens.

217
00:10:43.433 --> 00:10:45.333
- Or more!
- Awesome!

218
00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.100
En route to my next job,

219
00:10:47.166 --> 00:10:51.000
I saw dancing Pokémon out of the corner of my eye, so here I am.

220
00:10:51.066 --> 00:10:54.866
Uh, we're struggling with the choreography for our next performance,

221
00:10:54.933 --> 00:10:56.133
so could you help us?

222
00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.400
Ah, to be totally honest,

223
00:10:58.466 --> 00:11:01.000
La Grande Dame Brûlée is anything but cheap.

224
00:11:01.066 --> 00:11:06.000
It's for free. I just love helping performance newbies.

225
00:11:07.066 --> 00:11:10.000
Who's that Pokémon?

226
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.333
It's Smoochum!

227
00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.000
Smoochum!

228
00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:25.833
- This could be our big chance.
- We'll get all sorts of great tips.

229
00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:30.200
- Hm! Aw! Such a cutie!
- Smoochum!

230
00:11:30.266 --> 00:11:34.200
Being exposed to those precious lips and saucer eyes makes me turn to mush.

231
00:11:34.266 --> 00:11:38.200
- Don't forget the choreography.
- Uh? Ah! Yes, you're right.

232
00:11:38.266 --> 00:11:43.066
Rule one. Whatever moves you use, move them with style. Capisce?

233
00:11:43.133 --> 00:11:46.200
- Basic rules are the best rules!
- And how.

234
00:11:46.266 --> 00:11:47.700
Huh?

235
00:11:47.766 --> 00:11:50.033
- You wanna learn too?
- Pin.

236
00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.200
- Then let's all pay attention.
- Cham.

237
00:11:52.266 --> 00:11:55.966
Lift your legs high! Right! Left!

238
00:11:56.033 --> 00:11:57.533
Right! Left!

239
00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.600
- Right! Left!
- Aaah!

240
00:12:00.666 --> 00:12:02.500
Right! Left!

241
00:12:02.566 --> 00:12:05.933
Now twist your body to the right and left.

242
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:08.066
- And it's right! And left! And right!
- Ah!

243
00:12:08.133 --> 00:12:13.066
- OK, now, bring it.
- Voilà!

244
00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.600
Next, I'll have you dance inside this balloon.

245
00:12:23.666 --> 00:12:27.366
By working in a small space, your movements become more economical.

246
00:12:27.433 --> 00:12:29.900
- Oh, I see.
- Pika, Pikachu.

247
00:12:31.966 --> 00:12:36.166
Climb in quickly, before our teaching aid deflates.

248
00:12:36.233 --> 00:12:38.233
- Chespin!
- Pancham.

249
00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.900
Farfetch'd. Now.

250
00:12:39.966 --> 00:12:42.333
Ten-four!

251
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.633
And that's how it's done!

252
00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.166
Ah! What's happening?

253
00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:49.500
Hold on. I thought we were having a lesson.

254
00:12:53.166 --> 00:12:55.233
Prepare for trouble, a lesson it is!

255
00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.500
And make it double, you're in the wrong biz!

256
00:12:57.566 --> 00:13:00.066
To protect the world from devastation!

257
00:13:00.133 --> 00:13:03.033
To unite all people within our nation!

258
00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.933
To denounce the evils of two left feet!

259
00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.566
Face it, our footwork is frightfully neat!

260
00:13:08.633 --> 00:13:11.800
- Jessie!
- And James.

261
00:13:11.866 --> 00:13:15.300
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

262
00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:17.700
Surrender now or prepare for a footloose fight!

263
00:13:17.766 --> 00:13:20.233
Meowth, that's right!

264
00:13:21.366 --> 00:13:23.433
- Team Rocket!
- Who's that?

265
00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:26.233
Bad people who steal other people's Pokémon!

266
00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.933
Did they just steal our Pokémon?

267
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.900
The guest twerp's quick!

268
00:13:30.966 --> 00:13:33.400
- Gotta fly!
- Buh-bye-bye.

269
00:13:34.766 --> 00:13:39.333
See. There's one real queen, and that just happens to be me.

270
00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:42.900
So go ahead and practise until your faces turn blue

271
00:13:42.966 --> 00:13:47.033
Say. That colour might just look fabulous on you!

272
00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.366
- Come back here, Team Rocket!
- Chespin, no!

273
00:13:49.433 --> 00:13:50.800
Give Fennekin and Pancham back!

274
00:13:50.866 --> 00:13:52.766
Give back my Smoochum and Farfetch'd too!

275
00:13:52.833 --> 00:13:54.766
You can have this. Hah!

276
00:13:59.333 --> 00:14:03.366
-Pika!

277
00:14:04.566 --> 00:14:07.466
- Huh? Gone.
- What do we do?

278
00:14:07.533 --> 00:14:09.466
Fletchinder, go!

279
00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.700
Fletch!

280
00:14:11.833 --> 00:14:15.200
Fletchinder! Go up and find Team Rocket's balloon!

281
00:14:15.266 --> 00:14:17.133
- Fletchinder!
- Let's go take a look, too!

282
00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.200
Hm!

283
00:14:20.833 --> 00:14:22.766
- Well, that was easy
- Peasy!

284
00:14:22.833 --> 00:14:25.666
Some days our gig is bright, bubbly and breezy...

285
00:14:31.233 --> 00:14:32.600
- Smoochum!
- Farfetch'd!

286
00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:37.833
- Stop that! You're rocking the boat!
- Or in this case, balloon!

287
00:14:40.033 --> 00:14:43.266
Smoochum, sweetie, come back!

288
00:14:54.366 --> 00:14:56.566
-Cham?

289
00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.733
Pan?

290
00:15:03.433 --> 00:15:07.266
Farfetch'd.

291
00:15:09.233 --> 00:15:13.000
- Farfetch'd!
- Pancham.

292
00:15:14.033 --> 00:15:15.400
Che!

293
00:15:15.466 --> 00:15:18.100
- Pan!
- Che! Che!

294
00:15:18.166 --> 00:15:20.466
- Fennekin!
- Che?

295
00:15:20.533 --> 00:15:21.866
Huh?

296
00:15:21.933 --> 00:15:24.100
- Cham! Pancham!
- Che, che, Chespin, che!

297
00:15:24.166 --> 00:15:25.466
- Che?
- Cham.

298
00:15:25.533 --> 00:15:27.633
Inkay, Inkay! Ink.

299
00:15:28.566 --> 00:15:31.133
Ink? Inkay! Inkay!

300
00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.166
Pancham! Pancham! Pan!

301
00:15:33.233 --> 00:15:35.633
Ah! Cham!

302
00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.666
- Inkay!
- The jig's up. You're staying put.

303
00:15:38.733 --> 00:15:41.633
- The game's over.
- It's quittin' time.

304
00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.700
Chespin!

305
00:15:43.766 --> 00:15:45.433
- Pancham!
- Chespin!

306
00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.333
- Cham! Cham!
- Che! Che!

307
00:15:49.066 --> 00:15:51.000
What are they jabbering about?

308
00:15:51.066 --> 00:15:55.333
You know. "Leave it to me. I'll do it." "No, I'll do it." Dumb stuff like that.

309
00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:58.333
Hm... Use Psybeam.

310
00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.100
Inkay. Inkay!

311
00:16:01.166 --> 00:16:02.833
Chespin!

312
00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:07.966
- Cham.
- Che.

313
00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:10.166
Kin! Fenn!

314
00:16:10.233 --> 00:16:12.733
- Pumpkaboo, use Shadow Ball!
- Pumpka!

315
00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.566
Fennekin!

316
00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.133
Aaah!

317
00:16:22.366 --> 00:16:24.200
- Che?
- Cham?

318
00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:27.966
Don't you remember you're supposed to be friends? Now make up!

319
00:16:29.266 --> 00:16:33.933
Hey. All you're doing is just being plain mean to each other. Come on.

320
00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.600
Pin.

321
00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.100
- Cham, Pancham.
- Chespin.

322
00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.900
- Che.
- Cham.

323
00:16:42.966 --> 00:16:44.100
Hm?

324
00:16:44.233 --> 00:16:47.433
Please! What are you two going to do? Argue us to sleep?

325
00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.166
- Use Dark Pulse!
- Pumpka!

326
00:16:51.066 --> 00:16:52.533
- Che!
- Cham!

327
00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.900
- Pancham!
- Pin!

328
00:16:56.966 --> 00:16:59.266
Aah! Oof!

329
00:16:59.333 --> 00:17:00.500
Che!

330
00:17:00.566 --> 00:17:02.400
- Pancham!
- Pin!

331
00:17:04.066 --> 00:17:06.166
Yippee! Aren't we pleased with ourselves?

332
00:17:06.233 --> 00:17:08.633
- Inkay, use Tackle!
- Inkay!

333
00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.566
Che, che, che, Chespin!

334
00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.733
Inkay!

335
00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.633
Now, Psybeam!

336
00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.733
- Inkay!
- Che!

337
00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.266
- Chespin!
- Pancham!

338
00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.600
All right, Leech Seed!

339
00:17:29.133 --> 00:17:30.700
- Uh...
- Pin!

340
00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.733
- Hey!
- Chespin!

341
00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:35.700
- You all OK?
- Che?

342
00:17:35.766 --> 00:17:38.233
- Huh?
- The twerps!

343
00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:39.566
- Fennekin!
- Smoochum!

344
00:17:39.633 --> 00:17:41.633
- Farfetch'd!
- Where's Pancham?

345
00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:42.733
Chespin, are you OK?

346
00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.733
- Pancham!
- Che! Che, che!

347
00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:48.800
No! I knew these bores would show up sooner or later.

348
00:17:48.866 --> 00:17:49.900
Shadow Ball!

349
00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:54.133
-Che!

350
00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:56.600
- Che, che, che!
- Cham, cham, cham!

351
00:17:57.866 --> 00:17:59.000
Pancham!

352
00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:07.200
Look! Pancham and Chespin are battling like a team!

353
00:18:07.266 --> 00:18:10.533
- Pancham, that's great!
- Way to go, Chespin! Yes!

354
00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:13.566
- Pumpka!
- Ink, Inkay!

355
00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:17.866
- Are you ready for this, Pancham?
- Ready, Chespin?

356
00:18:17.933 --> 00:18:22.000
- Dark Pulse!
- Pancham!

357
00:18:22.066 --> 00:18:25.833
- Pin Missile, go!
- Chespin!

358
00:18:33.333 --> 00:18:35.433
OK, Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

359
00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:39.733
Pika, Pikachu!

360
00:18:42.766 --> 00:18:47.166
No! My cute little Smoochum-woochum, gone...

361
00:18:47.233 --> 00:18:50.633
- Such behaviour not befitting a queen.
- In her dreams.

362
00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:54.200
Yeah? Well this queen is not going to give up her performance throne!

363
00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:56.566
- Talk is cheap.
- Yours is the cheapest.

364
00:18:56.633 --> 00:18:59.133
We're blasting off again!

365
00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.566
- Pumpkaboo.
- Inkay.

366
00:19:07.366 --> 00:19:10.166
Oh, I'm so glad everyone's OK.

367
00:19:10.233 --> 00:19:11.733
Yeah, you really saved the day!

368
00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.333
- Great job. What a team!
- Che.

369
00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.433
You really work well together.

370
00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.733
Yeah. You two really were friends all along.

371
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.433
Pika!

372
00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:22.233
- Pancham, cham!
- Che, che!

373
00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.300
- Pancham!
- Che!

374
00:19:24.366 --> 00:19:25.800
-Oh, man.

375
00:19:25.866 --> 00:19:29.766
- I told you! Stop the fighting already!
- Pika, pika!

376
00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:31.733
This instant!

377
00:19:33.733 --> 00:19:36.600
Fighting a lot just proves they're great friends.

378
00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:50.866
- Nini? So I'll see you later?
- Mm-hm.

379
00:19:50.933 --> 00:19:54.666
Seeing how Smoochum and Pancham put their true feelings into their dance

380
00:19:54.733 --> 00:19:56.733
taught me a lot about Pokémon performance.

381
00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.800
I hope you compete in a Pokémon Showcase soon.

382
00:19:59.866 --> 00:20:02.100
And then, you and I will be rivals.

383
00:20:02.166 --> 00:20:04.866
- Yeah! And I'll beat you!
- Take care.

384
00:20:04.933 --> 00:20:07.600
Good luck with all your Pokémon performance work.

385
00:20:07.666 --> 00:20:09.533
- Bye!
- Bye! Thanks!

386
00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.200
Keep in touch, everybody!

387
00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.366
- Che?
- Cham?

388
00:20:16.433 --> 00:20:17.700
Keep up the good work.

389
00:20:17.766 --> 00:20:20.900
We'll keep practising and enter the Pokémon Showcase for real.

390
00:20:20.966 --> 00:20:23.100
- Fennekin.
- Pancham.

391
00:20:30.633 --> 00:20:33.700
A chance meeting with a new Pokémon performance rival

392
00:20:33.766 --> 00:20:39.166
has made Serena's desire to enter the next Pokémon Showcase even stronger!

393
00:20:39.233 --> 00:20:42.900
And so, with hopes and dreams burning brighter than ever,

394
00:20:42.966 --> 00:20:45.966
our heroes' journey continues!
